OL,3,GNEWSAHovercraft services cancelled due
OL,4,Ato weather
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral hovercraft services between
OL,7,FHampshire and the Isle of Wight have
OL,8,Fbeen cancelled following a technical
OL,9,Fissue and bad weather conditions.
OL,11,FHovertravel said its Island Flyer
OL,12,Fsuffered a door failure at Southsea at
OL,13,F12:30 BST and passengers were
OL,14,F"transferred to an alternative
OL,15,Ftransport option".
OL,17,FThe latest cancellations are the 17:00
OL,18,Fservice from Southsea and the 16:45
OL,19,Ffrom Ryde, affecting people travelling
OL,20,Fto the Victorious Festival in
OL,21,FPortsmouth.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
